{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Increase funding and review children\u2019s mental health system",
        "additional_details": "We are looking to see a change in children\u2019s mental health services as there are many families in crisis. We think there should be a complete review of all children\u2019s mental health services.\r\n \r\nWe are seeking for more funding for children\u2019s mental health support. This proposal could better our children\u2019s overall quality of life and give them the support they need in transition to adult life.\r\n",
        "background": "Many families with children suffering from mental health difficulties feel as though there is not enough support in place from services such as CYPMHS and CAMHS.\r\nIncrease funding and review the children\u2019s mental health system.\r\n",
